    "integration_strategy": "Ensure that the refactored static marker evaluation in feature1 is fully compatible with the dynamic xfail handling added in feature2. The changes in feature2 should build on the improvements made in feature1 so that marker evaluation remains consistent regardless of when a marker is added.",
